Gamma-centred mesh (use for fcc, hexagonal, 2D and tetrahedron runs)
0              ! 0 = generate the mesh automatically
Gamma          ! first character G/g = Gamma-centred
  8  8  8      ! N1 N2 N3, roughly proportional to |b1| |b2| |b3|
